This directory contains a QuIDDPro script which simulates a small
instance of Grover's quantum search algorithm.  The script
demonstrates how to implement and apply user-defined functions in
QuIDDPro.

Scripts
-------

simple_grover.qpro: A 3-qubit instance of Grover's quantum search
                    algorithm which utilizes a user-defined function to 
                    implement the oracle

oracle.qpro: The user-defined function which implements an oracle that marks 
             the last index of the search space
